        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage A-Series Levon Commercial Lever</b>\r\n<p>The Schlage Levon Lever can be used for either light to medium duty commercial or heavy duty residential use, making it an ideal choice for homes, office buildings, apartments, and hotels. The Available to fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Fits standard door cut-outs.</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSince its invention in 1925, the A-Series continues to be the cornerstone of Schlage's product line by setting the standards of the industry. Worldwide acceptance and use of the A-Series are testimony to the precision and integrity of its design. A-Series locksets are constructed of high strength steel and plated for superior corrosion resistance and maintenance-free performance.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Features</b> of the Schlage A-LEV Levon Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI 156.2, 1996, Series 4000, Grade 2. (Formerly FF-H-106C Series 160.)</li>\r\n<li>UL 3 hour fire rated.</li>\r\n<li>Lever is zinc based and plated to match BHMA symbols.</li>\r\n<li>6-Pin tumbler with two nickel silver keys per lock. Other keying options include master keying, grand master keying, construction keying, and interchangeable core.</li>\r\n<li>Cylindrical lock housing is made of cold rolled steel that has been corrosion treated for normal atmospheric conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Key removable outside levers for easy cylinder replacement.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><B>Specifications</b> of the Levon Schlage Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Levon Keyed functions will have Orbit Knob on outside.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 3-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 3-3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Orbit Knob Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Orbit Knob Diameter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional lever. For use as a pull or to match trim. Does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Exit Lock:</b> Blank plate outside. Inside lever always unlocked.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall, Closet, Storeroom):</b> Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Office or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Entrance Lock with Orbit Knob Outside Trim (Back Door):</b> Turning the push button on the inside locks the outside knob, making it require the use of key until the button inside is manually unlocked; and even if the push button is activated, turning the lever on the inside allows the door to open while still locking from the outside once door is shut.</li>\r\n<li><b>Classroom (Keyed) with Orbit Knob Outside Trim:</b> Outside knob locked and unlocked by key. Inside lever always unlocked</li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom (Keyed) with Orbit Knob Outside Trim:</b> Outside knob is fixed. Entry by key only. Inside lever always unlocked.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Levon Commercial Door Lever, Schlage A-LEV",
                "description": "The Schlage Levon Lever can be used for either commercial or residential use, making it an ideal choice for homes, office buildings, apartments, and hotels. Available to fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Fits standard door cut-outs. Available in 4 finishes.",
